				)
				(hide yes)
			)
		)
		(property "Description" "Prototype magnetic geometry: 2x B66421G0000X187 ungapped N87 cores; B66422W1010D001 one-section 10-pin bobbin; 2x B66422B2000X000 yokes. Primary 32T pins 1(start)-5(finish); reinforced insulation barrier; secondary 7T pins 10(start)-6(finish); pins 2-4 and 7-9 NC. The previous 24AWG winding callout is not approved for the 2Arms-primary / approximately 9.14Arms-secondary, approximately 240VA maximum condition. Conductor construction, window fill, core and copper loss, temperature rise, insulation system and production hipot must be redesigned and qualified before layout release. Footprint verified to 22.5mm row spacing, 5.0mm pitch and 1.3+0.1mm recommended holes."
			(at 191.77 76.2 0)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
